id: og_datahall_b
name: Data Hall II
description: Data Hall. Aisles between cabinets that are all exactly the same width, with a plant deck above and a battery hall below whose only purpose is to keep them running. Built as a colocation data centre; the hall failed over to batteries and nobody came to reset it.

